Third-party data and models (not covered by the MIT license above)

The MIT license covers the code in this repository. The datasets and models it
downloads keep their own licenses and are not redistributed here:

  - CNNDetection / ForenSynths (Wang et al., CVPR 2020; ProGAN training set and
    CNN_synth_testset): CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 (non-commercial, share-alike).
    https://huggingface.co/datasets/sywang/CNNDetection
  - UniverDiffu test set, diffusion_datasets.zip (Ojha et al., CVPR 2023):
    distributed by https://github.com/WisconsinAIVision/UniversalFakeDetect;
    its real images come from LAION and ImageNet and are subject to their terms.
  - Qwen3-VL-4B-Instruct (base model): Apache License 2.0.

The files in manifests/ list names, sizes and checksums of images in these
datasets. The images themselves remain under the datasets' original licenses.
